{"page_id": "realdoc_pages-images_db0c84e2_images_59eb68d8-1256-4b89-86cf-4f19ed1a91c5-p1", "markdown": "# Substitution of Insurance Carrier\n\nLIFE INSURANCE\n\nENDORSEMENT METHOD SPLIT DOLLAR PLAN\n\nAGREEMENT\n\nThe Life Insurance Endorsement Method Split Dollar Plan Agreement between Robert B.\n\nBantle as Insured and Tompkins Trust Company (the \"Bank\") dated Jan. 10, 2002\n\n(the \"Agreement) is amended to reflect the replacement of the Union Central Life Insurance Company and Security Life of Denver life insurance policies on the Insured in a tax-free exchange under I.R.C. Section 1035 with the Northwester Mutual Life Insurance Company, respectively as follows:\n\nInsurer.\n\nNorthwester Mutual Life is substituted for Union Central and Security Life\n\nPolicy Number:\n\n17188743 is substituted for U200001276\n\n17188897 is substituted for 660014737\n\nIn all other respects the Agreement is hereby ratified and confirmed.\n\n_(City, State) this.\n\n_21\n\n，2006.\n\nday of\n\nTompkins Trust Company\n\nIthaca, New York\n\nGala\n\nДині Латин\n\nRo\n\nN4 Ban\n\na B. Bant", "width": 637, "height": 833, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "Substitution of Insurance Carrier", "bbox": {"x": 211.66771151055124, "y": 73.91127096823142, "width": 217.65830721003132, "height": 17.97841726618703}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LIFE INSURANCE", "bbox": {"x": 255.59874672050157, "y": 107.8705034373142, "width": 131.79310344827584, "height": 15.980815347721816}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ENDORSEMENT METHOD SPLIT DOLLAR PLAN", "bbox": {"x": 145.77115977712805, "y": 141.82973620571215, "width": 349.45141065830717, "height": 17.97841726618703}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "AGREEMENT", "bbox": {"x": 269.5768024079938, "y": 177.78657072709836, "width": 101.8401253918495, "height": 15.980815347721816}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The Life Insurance Endorsement Method Split Dollar Plan Agreement between Robert B.", "bbox": {"x": 91.81103887170838, "y": 209.69453578813128, "width": 457.